      "text": {
        "hi": "किताब कहती है: तुम्हारा दोस्त छुट्टियों में घूमकर लौटा है। फ़ोन पर उससे उसकी यात्रा के बारे में सवाल पूछो। मैं दोस्त बनता हूँ, तुम सवाल पूछो!",
        "hinglish": "Kitaab kehti hai: tumhara dost chhuttiyon mein ghoomkar lauta hai. Phone par usse uski yaatra ke baare mein sawaal poochho. Main dost banta hoon, tum sawaal poochho!",
        "en": "The book says: your friend is back from a holiday trip. Ask about the journey on the phone. I'll be your friend; you ask the questions!"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "roleplay",
      "id": "B7.07.5.S02",
      "skills": [
        "book.talk",
        "speak.sentence"
      ],
      "scene": "📞",
      "turns": [
        {
          "id": "hi",
          "tinku": "Hello! I am back from my holiday trip.",
          "meaning": {
            "hi": "हेलो! मैं छुट्टियों की यात्रा से लौट आया।",
            "hinglish": "Hello! Main chhuttiyon ki yaatra se laut aaya."
          },
          "replies": [
            {
              "say": "Where did you go?",
              "meaning": {
                "hi": "तुम कहाँ गए थे?",
                "hinglish": "Tum kahan gaye the?"
              },
              "patterns": [
                "where did you go",
                "where did you go *",
                "where *"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "where",
          "tinku": "I went to Pachmarhi.",
          "meaning": {
            "hi": "मैं पचमढ़ी गया था।",
            "hinglish": "Main Pachmarhi gaya tha."
          },
          "replies": [
            {
              "say": "How did you go there?",
              "meaning": {
                "hi": "तुम वहाँ कैसे गए?",
                "hinglish": "Tum wahan kaise gaye?"
              },
              "patterns": [
                "how did you go there",
                "how did you go *",
                "how *"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "how",
          "tinku": "I went there by bus with my family.",
          "meaning": {
            "hi": "मैं परिवार के साथ बस से गया।",
            "hinglish": "Main parivaar ke saath bus se gaya."
          },
          "replies": [
            {
              "say": "What's the weather like at Pachmarhi?",
              "meaning": {
                "hi": "पचमढ़ी में मौसम कैसा है?",
                "hinglish": "Pachmarhi mein mausam kaisa hai?"
              },
              "patterns": [
                "whats the weather like *",
                "what is the weather like *",
                "how is the weather *",
                "* weather *"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "weather",
          "tinku": "It's really fine. It is cool and green.",
          "meaning": {
            "hi": "बहुत अच्छा है। ठंडा और हरा-भरा है।",
            "hinglish": "Bahut achha hai. Thanda aur hara-bhara hai."
          },
          "replies": [
            {
              "say": "What did you see there?",
              "meaning": {
                "hi": "तुमने वहाँ क्या देखा?",
                "hinglish": "Tumne wahan kya dekha?"
              },
              "patterns": [
                "what did you see there",
                "what did you see *",
                "what did you *"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "see",
          "tinku": "I saw waterfalls and caves. Bee Fall was beautiful!",
          "meaning": {
            "hi": "मैंने झरने और गुफ़ाएँ देखीं। बी फ़ॉल बहुत सुंदर था!",
            "hinglish": "Maine jharne aur gufaayein dekhin. Bee Fall bahut sundar tha!"
          },
          "replies": [
            {
              "say": "Did you enjoy your trip?",
              "meaning": {
                "hi": "क्या तुम्हें यात्रा में मज़ा आया?",
                "hinglish": "Kya tumhe yaatra mein mazaa aaya?"
              },
              "patterns": [
                "did you enjoy your trip",
                "did you enjoy *",
                "did you like *"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "enjoy",
          "tinku": "Yes, very much! I will show you the photos. Bye!",
          "meaning": {
            "hi": "हाँ, बहुत! मैं तुम्हें फ़ोटो दिखाऊँगा। बाय!",
            "hinglish": "Haan, bahut! Main tumhe photo dikhaaunga. Bye!"
          },
          "replies": [
            {
              "say": "Bye! See you soon.",
              "meaning": {
                "hi": "बाय! जल्दी मिलते हैं।",
                "hinglish": "Bye! Jaldi milte hain."
              },
              "patterns": [
                "bye *",
                "bye",
                "goodbye *",
                "goodbye",
                "see you *"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
